  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Sea Bath Salt Golden Glow, 250 g</strong><br/>\r\nBring on the shine and elevate your skin with the Sea Bath Salt Golden Glow. Sea Bath Salt contains natural oils and food-grade glitters. And you shine the brightest!<br/>\r\nSea salt baths help relax muscles and soothe the nervous system, while improving skin health, toning, and boosting elasticity.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Built-in glitters deliver a radiant, delicate shimmer to your skin.</li>\n<li>A delicate fragrance leaves a long-lasting, beautiful scent trail on the body. Top notes unfold instantly – delicate bergamot, tea; heart notes – floral, freesia, sambac jasmine, orchid, rose osmanthus; base notes – warm, soft, sweet, amber, patchouli, vanilla, musk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br/>\n<strong>The formula enriched with natural oils provides the body with extra care.</strong><br/>\n<strong>Shea Butter</strong> perfectly moisturizes and nourishes the skin, packed with unsaturated fatty acids, a vitamin complex, and antioxidants. It features powerful beneficial properties specifically aimed at skin restoration and UV protection, while accelerating regenerative processes, reducing flaking, preventing dryness, softening, boosting elasticity, and soothing irritation. <strong>Baking Soda</strong> helps soften, cleanse, and gently remove dead skin cells without causing irritation.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
