atural oils provides the body with extra care.</strong><br/>\n<strong>Shea Butter</strong> perfectly moisturizes and nourishes the skin, packed with unsaturated fatty acids, a vitamin complex, and antioxidants. It features powerful beneficial properties specifically aimed at skin restoration and UV protection, while accelerating regenerative processes, reducing flaking, preventing dryness, softening, boosting elasticity, and soothing irritation. <strong>Baking Soda</strong> helps soften, cleanse, and gently remove dead skin cells without causing irritation.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid784e37f1a0d0444c9f80c8ea41f4d0f6\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid784e37f1a0d0444c9f80c8ea41f4d0f6\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"c6bc26273b6ec3bfb826d0b97850cdf1\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"3d3ade64ba9bd0f69b6d